	<section_number>18.2-199</section_number>
	<catch_line>Penalties for violation of article</catch_line>
	<text>
		Persons violating any provision of this article for which no other specific punishment is provided for shall be guilty of a Class 6 felony.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 18.1-125.10; 1968, c. 480; 1975, cc. 14, 15.</history>
